Practical Takeaway

Today's most important lesson:

An AI Gateway becomes resilient only when routing and failure-handling policies are explicitly configured and tested under failure conditions.

We did not simply configure a backup model.

We deliberately broke the primary model and demonstrated that LiteLLM successfully routed the request to the backup model.

